            <div type="commentary">
                <p>A correction or alteration appears to have been made to the saint’s name. According to <ptr target="#Philotheou2021"/>, it is possible that the painter had initially intended to depict another saint who was also associated with pastoral activities, such as St Mamas or St Tryphon, and subsequently altered the name to Theosebios.</p>
